can review some of our newer stock.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202134\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1235/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24347/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6569/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930546/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.961      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   37.961      1 -total\n 47.54%   18.049      5 Template:Icon_text\n 42.56%   16.156     13 Template:Trim\n 23.72%    9.004      2 Template:Uid\n 17.30%    6.568      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.04%    5.330      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.40%    4.709      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.33%    4.679      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.56%    4.390      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31628-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202134 and revision id 195971. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}